---
// Success-green checkmark. Ink stroke on #4ADE80 keeps it legible (green-on-white text would fail contrast).
---
<span class="mt-0.5 inline-flex h-6 w-6 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-success text-ink" aria-hidden="true">
  <svg class="h-4 w-4" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
</span>
